# Trades two mitigations for speed on the Exynos 9610/9611 boards: the software PAN emulation
# and the Spectre-v2 firmware call on context switch. README.md ("Performance") has what each
# costs on this SoC and what it protects.
#   make exynos9611-gta4xl_defconfig gta4xl_fast.config
# CONFIG_ARM64_SW_TTBR0_PAN is not set
# CONFIG_HARDEN_BRANCH_PREDICTOR is not set
